    "unit": "u43",
    "prompt": "Leave a note for Vale, the pastry chef (your age, use tú). A customer cancelled a big cake order yesterday, and you are stuck with a lot of sugar and oil. Say what you, and Vale, would have done differently, and propose what to do with the leftovers.",
