    "unit": "u43",
    "prompt": "Write a formal email to a Spanish-speaking recruiter in Toronto (a stranger, use usted). They finally offered you the contract you wanted last year, but you have decided to stay in Bogotá. Explain that you finally made up your mind, that you do not regret it, and what you would have done a year ago.",
